WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.330
Upload your own contracts sheet, match its columns, check every row, see the problems, and import the good rows.

2
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:15.310
Every list that can be filled from Excel has an Import from Excel button.

3
00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:18.600
On Leases, choose it.

4
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:26.300
Drop your workbook here. This is the mall's own contracts sheet, with its own column titles.

5
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:34.400
The office reads your column titles and matches each one to a field. Green is sure; blue is likely.

6
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.400
Shop was matched to Units: that is right, so leave it.

7
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.580
Our remarks is not needed: choose Don't import.

8
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:48.760
The choices are remembered for next time. Check the rows.

9
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:54.950
Before anything is saved: three new contracts, and one row with a problem.

10
00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:02.040
Each problem says the row, the column and why: unit Z99 is not in the system.

11
00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:08.760
Download the problems marked in your own workbook, fix them in Excel and upload again.

12
00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:13.720
Or import the good rows now and skip the rest.

13
00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:17.800
Import. Everything is saved in one go.

14
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:25.290
Done: the new contracts are listed with links, and the import can be undone for fourteen days.
